abstract: >
  Public technical doctrine, structured examples, schemas, governance
  contracts, and benchmarking resources for evaluating Robbie’s Razor,
  recursive stability, compression efficiency, predictive compression,
  and preserved reusable structure. This repository is aligned with
  The Grand Compression Cosmology — Master Reference Document, MRD v2.0
  (GC-MRD-v2.0). Naturepedia is the primary reference implementation;
  implementation status does not by itself constitute independent
  empirical validation.

